                                        <h3>How accurate is modern OCR?</h3>
                                        <p>96-99.5% on printed structured documents. 85-93% on handwriting. LLM post-processing lifts accuracy 5-15 pp on messy documents.</p>
                                        <h3>Should I use Azure Form Recognizer, AWS Textract, or Google Document AI?</h3>
                                        <p>All are strong. Azure and Google slightly ahead on Arabic and multi-language. AWS Textract has excellent Queries API. Pick based on your existing cloud and specific document types.</p>
